k mountain,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1132:b003:l034","ordinal":381675,"en":"In some places it is forbidden"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1132:b003:l035","ordinal":381676,"en":"They play with each other,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1132:b003:l036","ordinal":381677,"en":"Hugging each other,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1132:b003:l037","ordinal":381678,"en":"A bad insult to the scandal"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1132:b003:l038","ordinal":381679,"en":"The two erens fell,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1132:b003:l039","ordinal":381680,"en":"Six in the day, six in the night"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1132:b003:l040","ordinal":381681,"en":"Standing up,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1133:b002:l001","ordinal":381682,"en":"Don't walk on the ground"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1133:b002:l002","ordinal":381683,"en":"Arguing around, -"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1133:b002:l003","ordinal":381684,"en":"Who has seen such work."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1133:b002:l004","ordinal":381685,"en":"Unnoticeable,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1133:b002:l005","ordinal":381686,"en":"The way is hard for the Knower"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1133:b002:l006","ordinal":381687,"en":"The husband is ninety,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1133:b002:l007","ordinal":381688,"en":"It is not known where."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1133:b002:l008","ordinal":381689,"en":"Chama is tired and tunes"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1133:b002:l009","ordinal":381690,"en":"All the food is gone,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1133:b002:l010","ordinal":381691,"en":"Get lost"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1133:b002:l011","ordinal":381692,"en":"Karasaat Bilgic"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1133:b002:l012","ordinal":381693,"en":"There is a hellish field below,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1133:b002:l013","ordinal":381694,"en":"In the body of the bigot"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1133:b002:l014","ordinal":381695,"en":"Wounded with no life."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1133:b002:l015","ordinal":381696,"en":"Red steel hen,"}]
